      "description": "Tesla is doubling, or perhaps tripling down on its bold claims of an autonomous future with the offer to \"select customers\" to purchase a Cybercab for \"personal use.\" But the gilded, steering-wheel-free two-seater will \"only be available in supported service areas\" - meaning you'll only be able to buy one if you live in one [&#8230;]",
